 | 126 | **工作區搬到 SSD**（EastSun「你之後可以在SSD 工作嗎 HDD速度很慢」）：D:\HT9045\_integ_ioweb 改成 junction → C:\HT9045_ssd\_integ_ioweb（switch_to_SSD.bat；舊 HDD 夾 D:\HT9045\_integ_ioweb_HDD_backup，切換後逐檔比對 0 差異；switch_back_to_HDD.bat 還原）。機台資料（system／config／IniData／HT9045_Log）仍在 HDD。o2 全建 8 分鐘、release 3 分鐘。**RS-232 面板／TFT 測試**（EastSun「你可以測試RS232 和TFT了」，wb_serve 關著）：COM1～6（這台只有這 6 個實體埠＋Intel AMT 的 COM7，沒有 USB 轉接器）①只聽 60 秒（115200、DTR/RTS）＝0 位元組；②送原版面板查詢 t051120／t050120／t051400000000／t050400000000（115200，另 9600／19200／38400／57600 問版本）＝全部無回應；③送原版 TFT SetNoBackGround 命令（9600 8N1，位址 0x20～0x23）＝全部無回應 → 兩種裝置在 6 個埠上都沒有任何回應，要電控確認接在哪個 DB9、裝置有沒有通電、埠是 RS-232 還是 RS-485 模式（工控主機 BIOS 常可切） | — | — |
 | 127 | **派工給 Jimmy（優先）：先行移植 RS-232 實體面板**（EastSun「較jimmy 先行轉 RS232 要測試了」；包 149 README 原排給 Ifor01）：GitHub dispatch\20261005_rs232pad_priority（3f2f64f）——golden uPadInterface 的完整路徑（ControlPanelMode、[TrayY] COM PORT 與 Tray 步進馬達共用、115200 8N1 DTR/RTS、t05 幀、按鍵位元、問版本／按鍵狀態、燈號、ProcessScanKey 接回 mysensor／myswitch）、移植樹要開的閘、機台 COM 清單與今天的探測結果（COM1～6 面板／TFT 都沒回應）、三支探測腳本 | GitHub dispatch | — |
 | 128 | **1203 IO 掃描搬到獨立執行緒（W906-IOTHREAD，方案 C）**（EastSun「你可以把掃描IO 辦到一個新的執行續嗎? 並且可以跟原本執行續 互通有無」→「應該還有更好的辦法吧」→ 方案 C →「直接做完就用 記得備份」）：計畫 D:\HT9045\_iothread_1005\PLAN_IOTHREAD.md；備份分支 backup/pre-iothread-20261005（cpp 8ae622d、web）＋ D:\HT9045\_iothread_1005\backup_pre_iothread（13 個原始碼＋兩個 exe）。做法：wb_serve 開機後起一條 IO 執行緒，**獨佔 1203 卡**——連續掃描（兩輪間隔 10 ms）＋執行主執行緒送來的所有卡片命令（TPci1203Control::Execute、Vc8SdoReadI16、SetTorqueFocusAxis 代轉，在掃描的讓出點服務＝最多等一個卡片呼叫；Rescan 只在兩輪之間）；每輪結束發布一份映像，主執行緒在原本呼叫 Poll 的地方取用（逐元素複製，參照位址不變），所有讀者欄位與執行緒都不變；「下指令後要等新樣本」的 13 個標記點改用 Pci1203IoFreshMark（取 IO 執行緒正在進行的那一輪），Galil 路線在執行緒跑時用 `<=`；關程式時在關站流程前停掉 IO 執行緒。開關 MachineType.h `W906_PCI1203_IO_THREAD`（預設開；註解掉＝原本單執行緒）。卡片沒開／測試＝不啟動、行為不變。o2 全建 0 錯誤；ctest 失敗＝已知清單（GaliRouteCore 第一次因 `==`→`<=` 失敗，改成只在執行緒跑時用 `<=` 後過）；production_audit 0。**要 EastSun 上機驗**：op log `IOTHR` 行、[FASTCLK] 每圈最慢、溫控漏跑、HOME／空跑／Motor Test／IO 按鈕反應 | cpp（見 commit） | 見 commit |
+| 129 | **IO 執行緒調校（W906-IOTUNE）**（EastSun 1006「你先自己啟動分析」）：計畫 D:\HT9045\_iothread_1006\PLAN_IOTUNE.md；備份分支 backup/pre-iotune-20261006。①**10-05 21:01 那一輪（Debug 版、IO 執行緒開）量到變差**：程式 CPU p50 34%→162%；IO 按鈕反應合計 p50 8.2→14.6 ms、p90 14.8→31.5 ms，多出來的是主迴圈重建畫面快取（每份新樣本都重建＋多發布一次）。②修：IO 執行緒的新樣本照樣立刻收（到位判斷用），但**畫面快取重建與多發布只在 IO 時鐘到期才做**＝以前的頻率（env W906_IOTHREAD_CACHE_EACH_POLL=1 回到每份都做）；間隔改可用 env **W906_PCI1203_IO_THREAD_GAP_MS**（=OFF 不啟動＝單執行緒），行號不動。③**我自己上機量（release、不開 HMI 網址、什麼都沒按，每組 45 s、sys.ping 60 次）**：單執行緒 CPU 77%、主執行緒 67.5%、ping p50 12／p90 77／最慢 1231 ms；間隔 10 ms CPU 126%（IO 執行緒 88.5%、主 26%）p50 2.0／p90 12.6／最慢 24；**30 ms 110%（IO 74%）p50 1.8／p90 6.6／最慢 22**；50 ms 100% p50 2.9／p90 10.1；100 ms 85% p90 19.3、最慢 374。→ 預設間隔 10→**30 ms**。主迴圈接手指令的最慢時間 1231 ms→約 22 ms。④發現：一次 Poll 本身約 80～90 ms 的**純 CPU**（不是等 IO），這才是樣本新鮮度的上限（30 ms 間隔 ≈ 每 115 ms 一份）——下一步要量 Poll 時間花在哪裡（DI／DO 快、從站／軸診斷慢 → 分快慢兩組）。每組都正常關站、8055 釋放 | cpp（見 commit） | 見 commit |
 | — | **還沒完成**：①**實體面板鍵還是讀不到**：COM1／3／6／7 聽 15 分鐘沒資料；COM2／4／5 被 wb_serve 佔著；EastSun 說面板「跟一般 9 系列一樣」、而且「不是用 1203」→ 待確認接法。②**1203 模組 ini（WAR16154）**：程式草稿已寫好，待整合。③**關 HMI 視窗時程式還沒開好**的情況（之後會自己再開視窗）：修法已規劃 | — | 見 §4 |
 | 41 | **VC4 閥值自己測**（EastSun「VC4 你自己測試 寫進去哪個位置 數值讀回來 會改變 自己推出來 用VC8」）：等 EastSun F5 後，用 Vacuum Unit 同一條命令對一格寫 -30 kPa、讀回、再寫回原值 | （測試中） | — |
 | — | 關掉軟體後 VS Code 上方的除錯工具列還在：wb_serve／gdb 都已經結束、8055 沒人佔，是 VS Code 沒發現結束；按紅色方塊即可（只會跑關站腳本，沒有東西可關） | — | — |
diff --git a/tools/wb_serve.cpp b/tools/wb_serve.cpp
index 910d294..31759b9 100644
--- a/tools/wb_serve.cpp
+++ b/tools/wb_serve.cpp
@@ -4668,10 +4668,10 @@ int main(int argc, char** argv)
         //  ⓘ 要不要為這次 Poll 多發布一次，看 card().open（「現在握著 device handle」）：
         //    沒握著卡時 Poll 什麼都沒更新；Poll 前後各看一次，涵蓋這一輪剛好放掉卡
         //    （附掛模式下量產那邊關卡 → detached）的轉換。
-        bool ioPolled = false;
-        if ((long)(now - nextIo) >= 0 || ht9045::Pci1203IoThreadSnapshotReady()) {   //AI(W906-IOTHREAD) 20261005: + "the IO thread published a newer poll" -- Poll() below then adopts it (TPci1203Monitor::Poll off the IO thread) and the after-Poll hooks run on it; not running = false (as before)
-            nextIo += static_cast<DWORD>(kIoTickMs);
-            if ((long)(now - nextIo) >= 0) nextIo = now + static_cast<DWORD>(kIoTickMs);
+        bool ioPolled = false;  const bool w906IoDue = (long)(now - nextIo) >= 0;  static const bool s_w906CacheEachPoll = [](){ const char* e = std::getenv("W906_IOTHREAD_CACHE_EACH_POLL"); return e != 0 && e[0] == '1'; }();   //AI(W906-IOTUNE) 20261006: PLAN_IOTUNE.md B -- the api cache rebuild + the extra publish only when the IO clock is due (the old rate); =1 = every adopted poll (10-05: CPU 162%, clicks queued behind the rebuild)
+        if (w906IoDue || ht9045::Pci1203IoThreadSnapshotReady()) {   //AI(W906-IOTHREAD) 20261005: + "the IO thread published a newer poll" -- Poll() below then adopts it (TPci1203Monitor::Poll off the IO thread) and the after-Poll hooks run on it; not running = false (as before)
+            if (w906IoDue) nextIo += static_cast<DWORD>(kIoTickMs);   //AI(W906-IOTUNE) 20261006: an adopt-only pass leaves the IO clock alone
+            if (w906IoDue && (long)(now - nextIo) >= 0) nextIo = now + static_cast<DWORD>(kIoTickMs);
             if (ht9045::TPci1203Monitor* mon = ht9045::Pci1203Monitor()) {
                 const bool wasOpen = mon->card().open;
                 // AI(W906-Q34-7-L2) 20260923 夜間：Poll 沒有 timeout 參數（同事量到一次約 140 ms），
@@ -4680,7 +4680,7 @@ int main(int argc, char** argv)
                 WdMark("1203 Poll");
                 { extern void W906_IoTiming(int); W906_IoTiming(3); mon->Poll(); W906_IoTiming(4); }  { extern void W906_MotorAccessPollTick(bool); extern bool W906_OwnerHeldSince(unsigned long long, unsigned long long&); static unsigned long long s_w906OwnerPoll = 0; W906_MotorAccessPollTick(W906_OwnerHeldSince(server.ControlOwner(), s_w906OwnerPoll)); }   //AI(W906-MERGE-0929) 20260929: review TK-1: a takeover (owner X -> Y) counts as "operator gone" for X for one beat, see W906_OwnerHeldSince at EOF   // AI(W906-IOWEB-P21) 20260925: phase mark for the click-latency log  //AI(W906-MT-E2) 20260925: right after Poll -- a 1203 LoopMove sees its arrival on the fresh sample (golden leg times), the Motor Test copy is refreshed (WebMotorAccessLive.cpp). Same line, so no line below moves
                 { extern void W906_Pci1203LinkWatchTick(); W906_Pci1203LinkWatchTick(); }  { extern void W906_Pci1203ModuleCheckTick(); W906_Pci1203ModuleCheckTick(); }  /*AI(W906-MODCHECK) 20261003: then the module presence check (EOF; EtherCAT/Pci1203ModuleCheck.h)*/  WdMark("tick");   //AI(W906-1203-LINKLOST) 20261001: EastSun 1001「1203 如果斷線10秒 要跳出異常」-- one link sample after every Poll; lost 10 s -> golden WAR16152 (EOF W906_Pci1203LinkWatchTick, EtherCAT/Pci1203LinkWatch.h). Same line, no line moves
-                ioPolled = wasOpen || mon->card().open;  g_apiCacheDirty = true;   // AI(W906-IOWEB-P6) 20260924: right after Poll(), same thread  // AI(W906-IOWEB-P25) 20260925: was rebuilt HERE, before the drain, so every click queued during the Poll also waited 20-160 ms for four JSON strings; now marked, rebuilt after the drain
+                if (w906IoDue || s_w906CacheEachPoll) { ioPolled = wasOpen || mon->card().open;  g_apiCacheDirty = true; }   /*AI(W906-IOTUNE) 20261006: see w906IoDue above*/   // AI(W906-IOWEB-P6) 20260924: right after Poll(), same thread  // AI(W906-IOWEB-P25) 20260925: was rebuilt HERE, before the drain, so every click queued during the Poll also waited 20-160 ms for four JSON strings; now marked, rebuilt after the drain
             }
         }
 #endif
@@ -9197,10 +9197,10 @@ void W906_IoThreadBoot()
 {
 #if defined(W906_PCI1203_IO_THREAD)
 #ifndef W906_PCI1203_IO_THREAD_GAP_MS
-#define W906_PCI1203_IO_THREAD_GAP_MS 10
+#define W906_PCI1203_IO_THREAD_GAP_MS 30   //AI(W906-IOTUNE) 20261006: was 10 -- measured on the machine idle (D:\HT9045\_iothread_1006\runs): 10 ms CPU 126% / ping p90 12.6 ms; 30 ms CPU 110% / p90 6.6 ms; 50 ms 100% / 10.1; 100 ms 85% / 19.3 (max 374); single thread 77% / p90 77, max 1231
 #endif
-    char why[200] = "";
-    const bool ok = ht9045::Pci1203IoThreadStart((unsigned long)(W906_PCI1203_IO_THREAD_GAP_MS), why, (int)sizeof(why));
+    char why[200] = "";  unsigned long gapMs = (unsigned long)(W906_PCI1203_IO_THREAD_GAP_MS);  if (const char* e = std::getenv("W906_PCI1203_IO_THREAD_GAP_MS")) { if (_stricmp(e, "OFF") == 0) { OpLine("IOTHR", "1203 IO thread OFF: W906_PCI1203_IO_THREAD_GAP_MS=OFF -- the IO is polled on the main thread"); std::printf("[IOTHREAD] 1203 IO thread OFF (env)\n"); std::fflush(stdout); return; }  const long v = std::atol(e);  if (v >= 1 && v <= 1000) gapMs = (unsigned long)v; }   //AI(W906-IOTUNE) 20261006: PLAN_IOTUNE.md A -- env W906_PCI1203_IO_THREAD_GAP_MS=<ms> overrides the compiled gap; =OFF = not started (the old single-thread poll), so A/B needs no rebuild; same line
+    const bool ok = ht9045::Pci1203IoThreadStart(gapMs, why, (int)sizeof(why));
     std::printf("[IOTHREAD] 1203 IO thread %s: %s\n", ok ? "ON" : "OFF", why);
     std::fflush(stdout);
     OpLine("IOTHR", std::string(ok ? "1203 IO thread ON: " : "1203 IO thread OFF: ") + why);
